WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
I'm the only one in the whole building

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:13,060
Who happens to be quiet?

3
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,500
What are you doing if you don't sleep in the middle of the night?

4
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:18,930
Execution in five days

5
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:21,090
The robber and murderer Wang is really not a hallucination

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:42,690
I can clearly see the words on the sign on the third floor.

7
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:43,770
It's a big ghost wall

8
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,770
Grandpa said you can't get out

9
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,080
I'm not afraid of anything

10
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,560
Come in half a day

11
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:06,530
I want to go home grandpa

12
00:01:07,010 --> 00:01:07,970
There is a ghost in the dormitory

13
00:01:08,170 --> 00:01:09,490
Chase me with chains

14
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:12,380
I'll never go to school again. Don't be afraid.

15
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:13,620
It'll be fine soon

16
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:16,500
Grandpa will take care of all these things, grandson

17
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:18,520
We won’t read this book anymore

18
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:19,840
Tomorrow I will learn how to settle down with grandpa
